This independent research implementation follows the DSpine method described in:
DSpine, Zhang et al. (2026), arXiv:2609.36173.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.36173
The paper text and Tencent checkpoint files are not redistributed here.
Reference checkpoint: https://huggingface.co/tencent/Qwen3-8B-DSpine-b16

DFlash provides the context-K/V parallel-drafting architecture on which DSpine
builds. We credit the DFlash authors and public implementation:
https://github.com/z-lab/dflash
Historical DFlash comparisons in the audit are this project's measurements;
the private runtime and historical third-party source are not distributed.

Qwen provides the target model family and transformer conventions.
https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3
Preview base model: RedHatAI/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4.
https://huggingface.co/RedHatAI/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4
No target weights are included in this code release.

